title: MVP success workflow
---
flowchart TD
    Init["apilens init"] --> Discover["apilens discover"]
    Discover --> List["See APIs in the project"]
    List --> Test["apilens test /api/users"]
    Test --> Watch["apilens watch"]
    Watch --> Open[Open the application]
    Open --> Seen["See GET /api/users, GET /api/profile"]
    Seen --> Gen["apilens generate request-id"]
    Gen --> YAML[Reusable YAML test]
    YAML --> Run["apilens run"]
    Run --> Suite[Full suite from the terminal]
